[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2880.39, "timestamp": "00:48:00", "text": "我把所有东西都准备好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2884.95, "timestamp": "00:48:04", "text": "嗯，是的。这就是阿迪昌所做的事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2888.95, "timestamp": "00:48:08", "text": "我。看看这个。这个菜单是不是很棒？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2892.47, "timestamp": "00:48:12", "text": "看看渐变效果。它是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2894.867, "timestamp": "00:48:14", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "it does look futuristic cyberpunk"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2895.75, "timestamp": "00:48:15", "text": "太酷炫了，很有未来感。不，那里有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2898.47, "timestamp": "00:48:18", "text": "这里是星座。我不知道是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2901.51, "timestamp": "00:48:21", "text": "你可以看到它。有一个星座"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2904.47, "timestamp": "00:48:24", "text": "下面这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2907.99, "timestamp": "00:48:27", "text": "是的，他帮了我很大的忙。他硬编码了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2912.549, "timestamp": "00:48:32", "text": "确实如此。他用Nex.js编写了这段代码。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2914.63, "timestamp": "00:48:34", "text": "我猜也是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2917.67, "timestamp": "00:48:37", "text": "是的。还有最新的直播。看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2920.23, "timestamp": "00:48:40", "text": "这。它就像用某种方式突出了这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2923.589, "timestamp": "00:48:43", "text": "边框半径等等。边界"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2926.63, "timestamp": "00:48:46", "text": "闪闪发光，一切都很完美。现在，嗯，玻璃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2930.069, "timestamp": "00:48:50", "text": "关于态射之类的东西，我看到了很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2933.99, "timestamp": "00:48:53", "text": "星座也是如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2937.75, "timestamp": "00:48:57", "text": "男人。他太酷了。嗯，是的，我也是"}]